              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A vaccine? (لقاح, laqāḥ.) Sweat? (عرق, ʿaraq.) A wrist? (معصم, miʿṣam.) A thumb? (إبهام, ibhām.) A muscle? (عضلة, ʿaḍala.) A season? (فصل, faṣl.) Childhood? (طفولة, ṭufūla.) An evening out? (سهرة, sahra.) Ramadan? (رمضان, ramaḍān.) The afternoon; an era? (عصر, ʿaṣr.) A theatre? (مسرح, masraḥ.) A cinema? (سينما, sīnimā.) A club? (نادي, nādī.) A farm? (مزرعة, mazraʿa.) The countryside? (ريف, rīf.) A basement? (قبو, qabw.) A chimney? (مدخنة, midkhana.) A doorstep? (عتبة, ʿataba.) A fence? (سياج, siyāj.) A courtyard? (فناء, fināʾ.)"
